{{! Common letter header. Two modes:
    - If company.headerImagePath is set → use pre-rendered image (highest
      fidelity vs Exstream baseline, non-editable — company info baked into PNG)
    - Otherwise → semantic HTML (editable, small pixel drift from baseline)
    Data expected:
      company: {
        headerImagePath?: "path/to/header.png",    // optional
        name, addressLine1, addressLine2, contactLine, website  // used only if no image
      } }}
{{#if company.headerImagePath}}
<header class="page-header page-header--image">
  <img class="page-header__banner" src="{{company.headerImagePath}}" alt="{{company.name}}" />
</header>
{{else}}
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="page-header__company">
    <p class="text-brand"><strong>{{company.name}}</strong></p>
    <p class="text-small text-muted">{{company.addressLine1}}</p>
    <p class="text-small text-muted">{{company.addressLine2}}</p>
    <p class="text-small text-muted">
      {{company.contactLine}}
      <span class="text-brand">{{company.website}}</span>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="page-header__logo">
    <img src="../assets/fwd-logo.svg" alt="FWD Insurance" />
  </div>
</header>
{{/if}}
